    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59705" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾰτευ-ταί</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶν</span>,
			οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stone</i> or <i>metal blocks on which a spit rests</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.214
			</span></i>, cf. Sch., <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				236
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολύβδινοι κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					171
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1425.388
			</span></i> (written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραδευταί</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				1425.415
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1541.20
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Archit.,
				<i>stones which support</i> a pavement, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.3073.105
			</span></i>, al.(Lebad.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			leaden <i>pigs</i> of specified weight, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.371.13
			</span></i>.</div>
